  "notes": "SPC Geoscience, Energy and Maritime (GEM) division / Pacific Maritime Boundaries programme EEZ polygons on Pacific Data Hub GeoNode, dataset 'Global Exclusive Economic Zones (200 Nautical Miles) - Merged Dataset' (CKAN metadata_modified 2026-11-02, version 1). 26 GeoNode layers in one SHAPE-ZIP: 22 PICTs + Australia, New Zealand, Matthew & Hunter overlapping claim, US Pacific remote islands (Howland & Baker, Jarvis, Palmyra, Wake). The CKAN resource URL used WFS 2.0.0, which returned lat/lon axis order in the shapefile; it was re-requested with WFS 1.0.0 (same layer list, generic /geonode/wfs endpoint) to get lon/lat. Attribute schema mirrors Marine Regions (MRGID, GEONAME, POL_TYPE, ...) plus 'source' (DOALOS deposit URL) and 'nation'. area_km2 attribute is wrong for GUM, MHL, MNP (m2 not km2) and missing for Wake. Licence CC BY-NC-SA 4.0, used under the CSDR-SPC data use agreement (D-019); selected EEZ base layer from 2026-11-20.",
